{"type":"json_object","final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006 (from $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005 to $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006).","value":6,"unit":"million","result_id":"tool:1","sources":["source:q11n3","source:q11n4"],"explanation":"Per the product warranties note, the reserve was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005. Change = 10 - 4 = 6 (million)."}}